cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software

title: "HGC-Layout: contrastive graph priors and adaptive force-directed optimization for text-driven urban scene layouts"
abstract: >-
  Source code, configuration files, synthetic demonstration data, and scripts for
  HGC-Layout, a framework that recasts text-driven urban scene layout generation
  as conditional generation on a multi-source heterogeneous graph. A graph
  attention encoder is pre-trained with a multi-view contrastive objective, and
  its node embeddings are shared by an autoregressive coordinate generator and an
  adaptive force-directed optimizer. The curated GeoSceneBench benchmark is not
  included in this repository.

